     "<div>Hi everyone,</div><div><br></div><div>For those interested in the DEB theory the biennial workshop is running next year (in the Greek Islands!). Details below:</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The website of DEB2025 is located here <a href=\"https://url.au.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/qistC4QZNwCzlooW0uxh5I4y1A2?domain=deb2025.sciencesconf.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://url.au.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/qistC4QZNwCzlooW0uxh5I4y1A2?domain%3Ddeb2025.sciencesconf.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239708332000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Xws2jT5gr_u4ZHEb-j6uG\">https://deb2025.sciencesconf.org/</a>. </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:white\">Registration\r\nof the Tele-course is already open and we hope as many experts as possible will\r\njoin the MOOC discussion groups </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">(<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);background:white\">27 Feb - 17 Apr 202</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:white\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">.\r\nWe would also like to revive the local discussion groups that will meet weekly\r\n(<a href=\"https://url.au.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/9DkeC3Q8MvCX2BBMAfgfLIQzqDx?domain=deb2025.sciencesconf.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://url.au.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/9DkeC3Q8MvCX2BBMAfgfLIQzqDx?domain%3Ddeb2025.sciencesconf.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239708332000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05y7Ka7fTL5NQ62wOm5vib\">https://deb2025.sciencesconf.org/resource/page/id/35</a>).</span><span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">The dates are as follows:</span><span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul type=\"disc\"><li><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">PART 1:\r\n     5-week International Tele-course - general online theoretical part (<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);background:white\">27 Feb - 17 Apr 202</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:white\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">)</span><span><span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">PART 2:\r\n     8-day Thematic School - practical training part (<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);background:white\">26 May - 3 June 202</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">)</span><span><span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">PART 3:\r\n     3-day International DEB Symposium (</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">4-6 </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">June, 202</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">)</span></li></ul><div>All the best and merry Christmas!<br>Mike<br></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>"
